OL,3,GNEWSADisappointment over Richard III
OL,4,Astatue vandalism
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of Leicester's best known statues
OL,7,Fhas been vandalised by being sprayed
OL,8,Fwith yellow paint.
OL,10,FThe statue of Richard III, which stands
OL,11,Fin Cathedral Gardens, was targeted
OL,12,Fovernight on Friday with crude
OL,13,Fanatomical shapes.
OL,15,FIt was donated to the city by the
OL,16,FRichard III Society in 1980 and
OL,17,Frefurbished as part of a #2.5m project
OL,18,Ffollowing the discovery of the
OL,19,FPlantagenet monarch's remains nearby in
OL,20,F2012.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
